---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const modes = [
  {
    number: 'III.1',
    plateId: 'E01-P10',
    title: 'Visual expression',
    href: '/manifesto/expression/visual',
    abstract: 'Meaning carried primarily through image, form, and graphic weight. The eye arrives before the mind.',
  },
  {
    number: 'III.2',
    plateId: 'E01-P11',
    title: 'Kinetic expression',
    href: '/manifesto/expression/kinetic',
    abstract: 'Meaning carried through movement, sequence, and change over time. Duration becomes the medium.',
  },
  {
    number: 'III.3',
    plateId: 'E01-P12',
    title: 'Verbal expression',
    href: '/manifesto/expression/verbal',
    abstract: 'Meaning carried through language — its precision, rhythm, and weight. Text is not a container; it is the substance.',
  },
  {
    number: 'III.4',
    plateId: 'E01-P13',
    title: 'Spatial expression',
    href: '/manifesto/expression/spatial',
    abstract: 'Meaning carried through the arrangement of empty space. What is absent defines what remains.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Expression" currentPath="/manifesto/expression">

  <h1>Part III: Expression</h1>
  <p class="page-meta">How work is revealed · 4 modes · January 2026</p>

  <div class="intro">
    <p>Expression is the final layer — how the work reaches its audience. After foundations have established constraints and composition has arranged what remains, expression determines the primary vehicle through which meaning travels.</p>
    <p>Choose one mode as primary. The others may be present, but subordinate. A work that attempts all four equally achieves none of them.</p>
  </div>

  <ul class="principles-list">
    {modes.map(mode => (
      <li class="principle-item">
        <div class="principle-number">{mode.number}</div>
        <div class="principle-content">
          <div class="principle-header">
            <h3><a href={mode.href}>{mode.title}</a></h3>
            <span class="plate-ref">{mode.plateId}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="principle-abstract">{mode.abstract}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <div class="section-note">
    <p>Expression without foundation is decoration. Foundation without expression is doctrine. The system requires both.</p>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  .page-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .principles-list {
    list-style: none;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .principle-item {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
    padding: 2rem 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .principle-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
  }

  .principle-number {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
    min-width: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .principle-content { flex: 1; }

  .principle-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .principle-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principle-item h3 a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .principle-item h3 a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .plate-ref {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    opacity: 0.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .principle-abstract {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .section-note {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .section-note p { margin-bottom: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .principle-item { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>